\title{\code{subset} and \code{elem} operators}
\date{2026-02-19T23:12:40Z}
\tag{discrete}

\import{discrete-macros}

\p{We can check whether one set is a subset of another using the \code{subset} operator (which can also be written \code{⊆}):}

\pre\verb<<<|
Disco> {1,3,2} subset {4,6,2,9,1,3}
T
Disco> {3,4,5} ⊆ {4,5,6}
F<<<

\p{We can also check whether a value is an element of a set using the \code{elem} operator (which can also be written \code{∈}):}

\pre\verb<<<|
Disco> 1 elem {3,6,1}
T
Disco> 3 ∈ {4,5,6}
F<<<
